Package: rts2-base
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: rsyslog
Description: Remote Telescope System 2 - core daemons and drivers
 RTS2 (Remote Telescope System, 2nd version) is a distributed control
 system for robotic astronomical observatories.
 .
 This package contains rts2-base: the database-free core (centrald, the
 wire protocol, rts2-mon) plus every device driver whose control library
 links statically (no bundled proprietary shared library) - dummy
 test drivers, the D50/SBT/FRAM mount, dome, focuser, filter wheel and
 sensor drivers. It does not include scheduling, the executor, or a
 database - those live in separate rts2-db/rts2-httpd packages. Vendor
 hardware drivers live in separate packages built from this same source:
 the Finger Lakes Instrumentation (FLI) drivers in rts2-drivers-fli (with
 their kernel module in fliusb-dkms), and the Moravian Instruments
 (gxccd) driver in rts2-drivers-gxccd.

Package: rts2-drivers-fli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, rts2-base (= ${binary:Version})
Recommends: fliusb-dkms
Description: Remote Telescope System 2 - Finger Lakes Instrumentation drivers
 RTS2 (Remote Telescope System, 2nd version) is a distributed control
 system for robotic astronomical observatories.
 .
 This package contains the RTS2 device drivers for Finger Lakes
 Instrumentation (FLI) hardware: rts2-camd-fli (cameras), rts2-focusd-fli
 (focusers), and rts2-filterd-fli (filter wheels), statically linked
 with FLI's libfli SDK 1.104 bundled in the source. USB devices are
 reached through FLI's fliusb kernel module (fliusb-dkms). Requires
 rts2-base for the surrounding configuration, system user, and systemd
 units.

Package: fliusb-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms
Description: Finger Lakes Instrumentation USB kernel module (DKMS)
 Kernel module for Finger Lakes Instrumentation (FLI) USB cameras,
 focusers and filter wheels: creates /dev/fliusb<n> for each attached
 device, which FLI's libfli (and so rts2-drivers-fli) talks to. FLI's
 module 1.5 with fixes for current kernels, built by DKMS for every
 installed kernel.

Package: rts2-drivers-gxccd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, rts2-base (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Remote Telescope System 2 - Moravian Instruments (gxccd) driver
 RTS2 (Remote Telescope System, 2nd version) is a distributed control
 system for robotic astronomical observatories.
 .
 This package contains rts2-camd-gxccd, the RTS2 device driver for
 Moravian Instruments (and G2/G3-compatible) CCD/CMOS cameras,
 statically linked with Moravian's libgxccd 0.12.1 (closed source,
 redistributed in binary form under its licence, see
 /usr/share/doc/rts2-drivers-gxccd/LICENSE.libgxccd). Requires rts2-base
 for the surrounding configuration, system user, and systemd units.
